{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id42194855"}, "name":{"label":"marczw"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-09-05T11:58:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"30.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"4731696682"}, "title":{"label":"Not usable with Airplay / HomePods"}, "content":{"label":"Hello, I was already writing you the issue but nothing has changed. The app and idea is simply great. \nWhat still does not work is using Airplay with my HomePods. Bluetooth AirPods or Headphones work fine. \nI pay for your service and simply want to use it absolutely standard and the app only crashes ...\nYou said also Apple employees love to use your service - so please get it going that your apps works properly then I instantly change my rating ...", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
